  id: hearthog
  dexNumber: 186
  displayName: Hearthog
  lore: A hedgehog whose quills are slow-burning coals. It banks them low to sleep
    and fans them bright when startled; farmers bake potatoes beside a drowsy one.
  personality: Grumpy when woken, generous with warmth.
